      "webtitle": "Ranch Data Migration Reminder",
      "content": "\u003Cdiv style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"\u003EAs initially announced in September 2025, the Ranch hardware upgrade requires all users to manually curate, then move, all data from the old hardware (old ranch) to the new hardware (new ranch). &nbsp;\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"\u003ESee the instructions here&nbsp;\u003Ca href=\"https://docs.tacc.utexas.edu/hpc/ranch-migration-2025/\" data-ogsc=\"\" title=\"https://docs.tacc.utexas.edu/hpc/ranch-migration-2025/\" data-outlook-id=\"1e0486f8-4984-4280-a4a9-9095358f464a\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 134, 240);\"\u003Ehttps://docs.tacc.utexas.edu/hpc/ranch-migration-2025/\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"\u003ETACC Staff will be removing the symbolic links to old Ranch effective November 1st, 2026.\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;\"\u003EEnsure your data has been migrated prior to this date.\u003C/div\u003E",
